</li>

</ul>
<br/>



<div class="well"><strong>Section 221(d)(3) BMIR, Section 235, and Section 236 Income Limits </strong></div>

 <ul>

  <li>Notice of FY 2023 Income Limits for the Section 221(d)(3) BMIR, Section 235, and Section 236 Programs in  <a href="/portal/datasets/il/il23/HUD-sec236-FY23.pdf"><strong>pdf</strong></a>
  </li>
  <li>Tables for Section 221(d)(3) BMIR, Section 235, and Section 236 Income Limits in <a href="/portal/datasets/il/il23/IncomeLimits-Section236-BMIR-FY23.pdf"><strong>pdf</strong></a>
  </li>
  
</ul>
<br/>



<div class="well"><strong>State Income Limits and Median Family Incomes</strong></div>

