</li>
</ul>
<br/>



<div class="well"><strong>Section 8 Income Limits </strong></div>

<ul>
  <li> FY 2022 Income Limits Methodology in <a href="/portal/datasets/il//il22/IncomeLimitsMethodology-FY22.pdf"><strong>pdf</strong></a>
</li>
