</li>

</ul>
<br/>



<div class="well"><strong>Section 221(d)(3) BMIR, Section 235, and Section 236 Income Limits </strong></div>

 <ul>

  <li>Notice of FY 2022 Income Limits for the Section 221(d)(3) BMIR, Section 235, and Section 236 Programs in  <a href="/portal/datasets/il/il22/HUD-sec236-FY22.pdf"><strong>pdf</strong></a>
  </li>
  <li>Tables for Section 221(d)(3) BMIR, Section 235, and Section 236 Income Limits in <a href="/portal/datasets/il/il22/IncomeLimits-Section236-BMIR-FY22.pdf"><strong>pdf</strong></a>
  </li>
  
</ul>
<br/>



<div class="well"><strong>State Income Limits and Median Family Incomes</strong></div>

<ul>
  <li>To view the FY 2022 State 30%, 50% and 80% Income Limits (based on median family incomes without adjustments made to HUD Income Limits), please  <a href="/portal/datasets/il/il22/State-Incomelimits-Report-FY22.pdf"><strong>click here</strong></a>. </li>

</ul>
<br/>



<div class="well"><strong>HUD 30% Income Limit for ALL Areas</strong></div>

