<div class="well"><strong>Section 221(d)(3) BMIR, Section 235, and Section 236 Income Limits </strong></div>

 <ul>

  <li>Notice of FY 2021 Income Limits for the Section 221(d)(3) BMIR, Section 235, and Section 236 Programs in  <a href="/portal/datasets/il/il21/HUD-sec236-2021.pdf"><strong>pdf</strong></a>
  </li>
  <li>Tables for Section 221(d)(3) BMIR, Section 235, and Section 236 Income Limits in <a href="/portal/datasets/il/il21/IncomeLimits-Section236-BMIR-FY21.pdf"><strong>pdf</strong></a>
  </li>
  <li>Data for Section 221(d)(3) BMIR, Section 235, and Section 236 Income Limits in <a href="/portal/datasets/il/il21/S235-S236-FY21.xlsx"><strong>MS EXCEL</strong></a>
</li>
