									<P> <A HREF="/portal/datasets/IL/FMR00/SEC82000.DOC">Click here</A> to download the nationwide copy of Section 8 income limits in WORD format<P> <A HREF ="/portal/datasets/IL/FMR00/incfy00.xls">Click here</a> download the FY 2000 Income Limits in Excel format.<P> <a href="/portal/datasets/IL/FMR00/allst00.txt">Click here</a> to obtain an ASCII national data file with all counties and county subparts.<P> <a href="/portal/datasets/IL/FMR00/def00.html">Click here</a> to obtain the income limit area definitions.<P> <A HREF ="/portal/datasets/IL/FMR00/medians2.html">Click here</a> for median family income calculations and State median family incomes.<P> <a href="/portal/datasets/IL/FMR00/pdr00.html">Click here</a> to learn how the income limits for the Section 221(d)(3)BMIR, Section 235, and Section 236 programs are calculated. <a href="/portal/datasets/IL/FMR00/S2362000.DOC">Click here</a> to obtain a WORD version of the income limits for the Section 221(d)(3)BMIR, Section 235, and Section 236 programs.<P> To view information for a given county or to download information for a specific State, go to the U.S. map below and click on the State you are interested in. The file format is described below the map.</p>

<P> <IMG border=0 SRC="images/usa99.gif" alt="map" usemap="#usmapMap00"></P> 

<script>
function getStateFile00(stateName) {
    if (stateName != 1) {
        link = "http://www.huduser.gov/portal/datasets/il/fmr00/hud00"+stateName+".txt";
        window.location = link;
    }
}
</script>

<p>You can also use the Dropdown below:</p>
